### Health check — /api/healthcheck
#
# The liveness probe needs nothing at all, which makes it the quickest way to confirm the API is up
# and the environment file was loaded before running anything else here.

### Liveness (UC-30) — anonymous.
# Answers as long as the process is serving. Reads no dependency, so it stays 200 even when the
# database is unreachable — use the detailed check below to tell those apart.
GET {{host}}/api/healthcheck

### Per-dependency status (UC-30) — System Admin.
# Run auth.http's "Login" first. Names each dependency and its status.
GET {{host}}/api/healthcheck/detailed
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Signing keys — anonymous.
# The public keys Heimdall's tokens verify under, as an RFC 7517 key set: the current key first, then
# the previous one during a rotation. Outside /api, and served by the API's own host only.
GET {{host}}/.well-known/jwks.json
